{"title": "卡都卫欧族", "index": 4, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\" id=\"2RHM0-d9d5622e4fa94b2684fb5c6c0e0ef5ab\">\n<div class=\"calibre1\" id=\"2RHM1-8d17ed04da64471f9c1bdd90d04a5bb6\">\n<a class=\"calibre2\" id=\"page13\"></a>\n</div>\n<h1 class=\"calibre3\" id=\"calibre_pb_0\">卡都卫欧族</h1>\n<p class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"picture\" class=\"calibre4\" src=\"../images/00042.jpeg\"/></p>\n<div class=\"title_pic\">\n    卡都卫欧少女准备她的发情期仪式\n  </div>\n<div class=\"calibre1\">\n<a class=\"calibre2\" id=\"page14\"></a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"picture\" class=\"calibre4\" src=\"../images/00008.jpeg\"/></p>\n<div class=\"title_pic\">\n    土著的脸画\n  </div>\n<div class=\"calibre1\">\n<a class=\"calibre2\" id=\"page15\"></a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"picture\" class=\"calibre4\" src=\"../images/00064.jpeg\"/></p>\n<div class=\"title_pic\">\n    土著的脸画\n  </div>\n<div class=\"calibre1\">\n<a class=\"calibre2\" id=\"page16\"></a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"picture\" class=\"calibre4\" src=\"../images/00014.jpeg\"/></p>\n<div class=\"title_pic\">\n    一位卡都卫欧妇女的作品\n  </div>\n<div class=\"calibre1\">\n<a class=\"calibre2\" id=\"page17\"></a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"picture\" class=\"calibre4\" src=\"../images/00061.jpeg\"/></p>\n<div class=\"title_pic\">\n    卡都卫欧少女·1895（取材于贝吉阿尼）\n  </div>\n<div class=\"calibre1\">\n<a class=\"calibre2\" id=\"page18\"></a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"picture\" class=\"calibre4\" src=\"../images/00107.jpeg\"/></p>\n<div class=\"title_pic\">\n    画脸的卡都卫欧妇女\n  </div>\n<div class=\"calibre1\">\n<a class=\"calibre2\" id=\"page19\"></a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"picture\" class=\"calibre4\" src=\"../images/00093.jpeg\"/></p>\n<div class=\"title_pic\">\n    画脸的卡都卫欧妇女\n  </div>\n<div class=\"calibre1\">\n<a class=\"calibre2\" id=\"page20\"></a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"picture\" class=\"calibre4\" src=\"../images/00095.jpeg\"/></p>\n<div class=\"title_pic\">\n   